From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ivo Nunes <ivo@nunes.uk>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 12:06:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Make Jolt the default 3D physics engine when Godot Physics is
 left out

Only Godot Physics 3D registers itself as the default 3D physics
server. In a build with module_godot_physics_3d_enabled=no, a project
whose physics/3d/physics_engine is DEFAULT (any project that never
changed it, and every 2D project) falls back to the dummy server:
3D physics silently does nothing, and every launch prints "Falling
back to dummy PhysicsServer3D".

Jolt now sets itself as the default when Godot Physics 3D isn't
compiled in. Builds with Godot Physics are unchanged.

Test: a project with no physics settings, containing a RigidBody3D,
run with --headless. Before, the body stays where it is and the
warning prints. After, it falls.

Upstream: no existing issue or pull request; to be proposed.
---
 godot/modules/jolt_physics/register_types.cpp | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/godot/modules/jolt_physics/register_types.cpp b/godot/modules/jolt_physics/register_types.cpp
index 13743033..1223c95f 100644
--- a/godot/modules/jolt_physics/register_types.cpp
+++ b/godot/modules/jolt_physics/register_types.cpp
@@ -36,6 +36,7 @@
 
 #include "core/config/project_settings.h"
 #include "core/object/callable_mp.h"
+#include "modules/modules_enabled.gen.h" // For godot_physics_3d.
 #include "servers/physics_3d/physics_server_3d_manager.h"
 #include "servers/physics_3d/physics_server_3d_wrap_mt.h"
 
@@ -58,6 +59,11 @@ void initialize_jolt_physics_module(ModuleInitializationLevel p_level) {
 
 	jolt_initialize();
 	PhysicsServer3DManager::get_singleton()->register_server(PhysicsServer3DManager::JOLT_PHYSICS_NAME, callable_mp_static(&create_jolt_physics_server));
+#ifndef MODULE_GODOT_PHYSICS_3D_ENABLED
+	// Without Godot Physics, Jolt is the only 3D physics engine, so it becomes the default.
+	// Otherwise projects that don't choose an engine would fall back to the dummy server.
+	PhysicsServer3DManager::get_singleton()->set_default_server(PhysicsServer3DManager::JOLT_PHYSICS_NAME);
+#endif
 	JoltProjectSettings::register_settings();
 }
 
